": "vlcsnap-2025-02-04-19h08m23s668.png", "id": "586218234253057", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392046_586218237586390_8024457248509373081_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nqiAMEm_pHgQ7kNvwG2rbOT&_nc_oc=AdrQrR-e0SCa3h5ucj48UoUx2Z792uR5klOfNb0Kq6cFwHl6S3dQ9SZ1ivJn_dHqE6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6nrFmvRu7Q-xQzGd51H0t2KmgcMfmUglgiKqcvSFbp3g&oe=6A1D8B56"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-02-04-19h11m26s654.png", "id": "1155966559241832", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391887_1155966562575165_5734748218768174927_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_bR8ivm7dsEQ7kNvwEBIjRL&_nc_oc=Adoss__fc7JFFIq4LSOi6YHgce1LtU9VZleJei-qWg1LjzTU_zKIxUMW1B3yFgO-7iU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7eLAlEhjLtps21N7xgoWPzQ8UV-FafsqXg1Y8LnStmTQ&oe=6A1DAD54"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-02-04-19h11m37s275.png", "id": "3679539902338259", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393469_3679539905671592_2627122416349441720_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jz3rvbw6mk0Q7kNvwH482uu&_nc_oc=Ador2poi243GJ7pYqBgOcrYC_KokHKDEdqqKfmzZJk47daGwgTP7eomVgN6_ZsJE1z8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4PanYMrbEmEH75G5E9oACHP5MJLuK-BdUV-iMWnHvNkw&oe=6A1D8696"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-02-04-19h10m04s938.png", "id": "1356238652047964", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392170_1356238655381297_7560635897474581615_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aTOyEc8zS2AQ7kNvwG716fW&_nc_oc=AdpT-lM3faYb58ZDw3oUMMWFOBukKyVbtn21w7XmUGTXJHUXOt1V9TKjgxhQ4dqwgv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5FD7OS0o1p_fKvg5itiVvmHWBEHY-YnPR8DvNftwau2Q&oe=6A1D8251"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-02-04-19h11m13s754.png", "id": "3910164702587175", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392057_3910164705920508_8933309247422837719_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ADhgbgJmlSgQ7kNvwEiVBqo&_nc_oc=AdrdkdK_BrPiHgWMzdd-dQOGWJzuTUwLgHGzulMDOCdA8ZdnlxGTr_jLKM1j2h7gbvg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6drswg7VYbc0dH8-7cJQBRpGGDEvf_Zvp1J_DgPwFSFA&oe=6A1D8278"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PV Associate", "keywords": ["PV", "Training", "Immerselearn"], "long_description": "PV Associate is part of the Immerse Learn PV Associate Certification Program and is accessible only to students enrolled in the program. This VR simulation provides a comprehensive, hands-on learning experience in photovoltaic (PV) technology. Training modules include system design, installation, and maintenance; PV components and their roles in operation; safety considerations and regulatory compliance; solar resource assessment; system sizing and optimization; structural and electrical requirements; energy storage integration and hybrid systems; commissioning and troubleshooting; and long-term maintenance. Learners will also explore financial aspects such as incentives and utility bill analysis. Developed to align with industry standards, PV Associate offers a safe, immersive environment where students can build technical expertise, improve safety awareness, and gain practical skills for real-world solar energy careers. Access is restricted to enrolled students only.", "short_description": "PV Associate is a VR training app developed as part of the Immerse Learn PV Associate Certification Program. Available exclusively to enrolled students, it offers hands-on training in photovoltaic (PV) systems, covering system components, design, installation, safety, performance optimization, and maintenance in a realistic virtual environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Immerse Learn", "support_websit